BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (connects faster, sounds better, and converts better. Phone-number targets must include the country code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm ([8ojiGzzsrV0 @ 00:02:20]. The campaign training layers on the controls that protect margin. These include) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (reporting duplicate calls, treating anonymous callers as duplicates, and paying out once per caller) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (regardless of publisher. Recording is on by default, with an option to trim silence. Payouts can be fixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (amounts triggered on call length, connection, inbound call, or conversion, or a revenue share with limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm ([BOFMLupLrSM @ 00:01:12]. On each target, the connection timeout defaults to 30 seconds before the call) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (reroutes, and priority 1 is the highest. Two targets with equal weight split traffic 50/50. Caps run on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (conversions, connections, or revenue at overall, monthly, daily, or hourly levels, with a separate concurrency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (ceiling [BOFMLupLrSM @ 00:06:12]. The targets training adds tag routing filters with AND and OR rules. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (also adds an RPC setting that controls how estimated revenue per call is calculated for each destination) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm ([2p-PtocR9pE @ 00:02:29].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Ring trees are where Ringba runs the auction. Matthias Musters splits the setup into two layers. The ring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (tree target is a normal destination with hours, caps, and concurrency, plus a request URL your buyer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (supplies for pinging. The ring tree houses one or more of those targets. In the demo, the ring tree carries a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (minimum revenue of $29.01. If no dynamic bid clears that floor, the call drops to a static buyer paying $29,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (then to one paying $25 [WOqDYpchQOo @ 00:03:31]. Selling into RingbaX follows an exact recipe. Create) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (RingbaX as a buyer, and name the ring tree target by category and traffic source. Toggle dynamic number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (so the destination arrives during the ping and post, and set Pacific time. Paste the seller offer's bid URL with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (appended parameters and use GET. Parse the bid with JPath on bidAmount and parse call acceptance with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (JavaScript. Then build a ring tree named with an RT suffix, with zero minimum revenue and zero failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (revenue. It converts on dynamic call length from connect, with a 10-second dial timeout and a 3,000 ms ping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (timeout [uDzWrD17wqg @ 00:02:04]. On the buy side, RingbaX offers static or Ringba RTB destinations. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (higher minimum duration lowers your priority in the exchange, and hitting the daily budget stops all bidding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm ([wyW52qkPCrc @ 00:02:26].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (ceohec runs the same machine on Retreaver, which they describe as free to open and pay-as-you-go at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (roughly 4 cents a minute. They enable performance marketing and RTB from the shopping cart, then split) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (campaigns by vertical and even by buffer time. They quote auto insurance buffers at anywhere from 90 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (180 seconds. The route needs only dummy data, and the IVR prompts should be left alone [RWVdTqjVYE8) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (@ 00:01:09]. The default conversion criteria act as a fallback, such as a $40 lowest bid on a 120-second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (auto buffer, while the real bids live as tags at the publisher level. For a publisher such as Market Call,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (ceohec creates an RTB postback key with a TTL of 45 seconds and a 5-second timeout. They send the link) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (over Telegram and tag the conversion criteria to the exact campaign ID, because without a response to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (publisher's ping you get no calls [RWVdTqjVYE8 @ 00:08:03]. Buyers on RTB still need a dummy number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (plus a pass-through ping webhook. More negative priority wins first, and a buyer left out of the campaign) Tj ET
