BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (in unsecured credit card debt. Pressing one means qualified, and the call is forwarded to the buyer. Pressing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (two means not qualified. Only the qualified leg earns the affiliate the commission [4dnXkZ7u6zw @) Tj ET
