BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (press something that is not the correct answer, so a press one for coverage triggers a second, longer menu) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (that opens with please listen carefully as our menu has changed and splits Medicaid, Medicare and no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (government benefits into separate keys before a call is written off [tf4AieS7Mhc @ 00:02:13]. Corona also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (found callers tune out a single voice, and swapping voices across prompts keeps them alert, a finding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (credited to plain testing [tf4AieS7Mhc @ 00:07:06]. Spam is the other leak: Ringba's robocall verification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (template plays a text-to-speech press one to continue, and any robocaller unable to complete it has the call) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (automatically terminated before it ever reaches a target [Ua5XxaPrhRs @ 00:04:54]. SignalWire's Nicholas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (handles callers who time out or hit an unknown input with a set variables module that increments an attempt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (counter, plays an audio file confirming something went awry, loops back to the gather, and disconnects after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (two failed attempts [VByuomL6T0s @ 00:04:54]. Without that loop, confused callers either get dumped or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (route blind, and both outcomes burn paid traffic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Build errors stall launches more often than strategy does. Ringba's IVR builder refuses to save a tree that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (lacks a hang-up node for calls that fail to connect to the routing plan, marking the error in red on the node) Tj ET
