BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (both transfers because no target number had been configured for sales or support [5z0mahGmR40 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (00:01:53]. Landerlab's call flow threw publish errors until each router branch had a routing plan selected,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (and the team verified the number pool script by checking that the base number on the page was replaced by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (a Ringba pool number before running a live mobile test and reading the carrier tag in the call log) Tj ET
