BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (Retell inbound webhook has a ten-second timeout, retries up to three times, and then defaults to the agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (already set on the number, so a slow make.com scenario lands callers on that fallback agent; the dynamic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (variable name must also match exactly, and the webhook was locked down by whitelisting the Retell IP) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm ([p7WavoW_6to @ 00:04:24]. Test every branch end to end before buying traffic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Economics leaks show up after the build, not during it. Autocia Technologies' Sanya warns that channels) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (cap concurrent calls: five channels means five people can call together without anyone getting a busy tone,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (and the dashboard tracks answered, not answered and canceled calls plus answer rate per number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm ([tdZ944Oycuo @ 00:02:28]. Missed calls need a recovery path, so WildJar routes unanswered transfers to) Tj ET
