BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (the next lever. Adam recommends configuring buyer concurrency hourly by day rather than flat, after asking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (each call center when lunch costs them 20% of capacity, when the 2 p.m. shift change adds seats and when) Tj ET
