BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (voicemail and will more than likely go unpaid, which is why buyer targets need hours including lunch and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (breaks [0QJvQjrUoX8 @ 00:01:36].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Geo and qualification mistakes bleed money quietly. Roughly 35% of people carry an area code that does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (not match where they live, so area-code routing means approximately 35% of the time a ready-to-buy caller) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (may land on an unlicensed buyer and never get paid [yFkULiyenzk @ 00:02:27]. Adam walks the scenario) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (live: a 248 Michigan number calling from Alaska gets disqualified within 10 or 15 seconds, well short of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (60-second duration billing typical in insurance, and networks shrug because the affiliate eats the loss, while) Tj ET
