BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (Account death is the most repeated firsthand loss. Soares Junior left Facebook because his accounts kept) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (getting disabled. Then his Google account was suspended mid-test for 'detected suspicious payment') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm ([mRb5vDti0sI @ 00:05:22]. OnlineSyndrome builds its whole pitch on the same wound: 'our accounts keeps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (on getting suspended,' with call-only ads disappearing and policy shifts every two to three years. Its answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (is AI-assisted landing pages and suspension appeals [wybWVvxFiI0 @ 00:01:14]. Marketcall flags two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (self-inflicted triggers on Meta. Uploading bought lists as custom audiences can get the account suspended.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (Coronavirus-angle health ads are risky enough that some advertisers resort to cloaking [9msaK2zlGMI @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (00:24:34]. Network access is its own gate. Vanel Sylvestre says networks detect applicants from Pakistan,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (Bangladesh, India, and Haiti, which is why he routes through a $2 PureVPN. His pages also geo-localize) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (visitors and block non-US traffic with a 'Service available in the United States only' notice [B2slPImGPD8 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (00:15:10]. John Ventura puts compliance first for the same reason, pointing to FTC and state crackdowns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (and TCPA fines of $500-1,500 per violation. Across these operators, the ad account, payment profile, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (network approval all sit upstream of every call-economics spreadsheet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (The second trap is paying for calls that never bill. ExclusiveLiveCall runs the math: $1,000 buys 50 calls, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (only 30 are billable at $60. That $1,800 in revenue leaves $800 before other expenses, which is why 'quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (and economics have to be measured together' [grygjesM2j8 @ 00:01:48]. Marketcall's Facebook health) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (benchmarks put billable rates at 40-70%, turning $8-15 raw calls into $20-25 billable calls at 20-50% ROI,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (and callers must be able to afford $150 a month. Ryan Moran prices the leak up front. Assume 50%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (click-to-call and one in three calls chargeable, so a sale costs roughly six clicks, or CPC times six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm ([yB7cDGVlP0k @ 00:05:59]. Downey Marketing traces clicks without calls to Performance Max and Smart) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (spam, broad keywords, lumped ad groups, and homepage traffic. The fix is Search Terms reviews,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (negatives, and focused mobile landing pages [_VG0M_8UuLs @ 00:04:08]. Jordan Sordo of Ringba adds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (the feedback loop: listen to call recordings and push every irrelevant request into the negative list) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm ([YhBQnt2AHbI @ 00:00:59]. Sabri Suby enforces the same discipline on lead ads, killing anything that runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (two times above his $15 lead KPI, and warns that instant forms deliver spam emails. For brokers the stakes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (compound, because Nate Ancelet warns that bad calls kill buyer relationships.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (The last failure is operational: calls arrive and nobody answers, or the buy side breaks. John Ventura says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (80% of callers won't leave a voicemail. Answering within 30 seconds converts at 31%, while waiting five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (minutes drops it to 4%. His routing therefore fails over after 10-15 seconds to an auto-SMS or a callback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (inside five minutes [GV0ML_xytX8 @ 00:07:43]. Marketcall's TrackDrive sequence runs a call, an SMS after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (five seconds, then a second call at five minutes. A call center converts best but costs about $15 per agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (hour, often with a $1,000 weekly minimum [9msaK2zlGMI @ 00:37:53]. Nate Ancelet lists the broker-side) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (traps: promising 200 calls and delivering 50, unvetted affiliates, and a single buyer as a single point of failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm ([q4tpqSo7KCE @ 00:10:40]. ExclusiveLiveCall echoes the concentration risk on the traffic side and insists) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (on respecting each buyer's allowed sources [grygjesM2j8 @ 00:10:37]. Ventura also flags DIY stack sprawl,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm ('10 different tools in 90 days,' and rising input costs, with Facebook cost per lead climbing from $8 in 2020 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm ($25+ in 2024. Speed is non-negotiable for Sabri Suby too, who calls every opt-in within 60 seconds. Ryan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (Moran adds a sales-side miss of his own: urgent care decision-makers were too hard to reach.) Tj ET
