BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 637.77 Tm (The Integrity Connect inbound program punishes picky agents by the numbers. Trey and Shanti Berlin of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 622.55 Tm (Ringba explain that a $5 revenue per call forces publishers to produce calls for about $4, while a $20 RPC) Tj ET
