BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 576.87 Tm (calls with no conversion. Over a 50-call running total, an RPC under $5, possibly raised to $8, gets the agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 561.65 Tm (turned off, and penalties escalate from a temporary pause to a one-week pause to removal [N3imbfBa8rI @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 546.42 Tm (00:26:18]. Adeline puts the floor near $9 and runs about $18 RPC by taking roughly 40 percent of calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 531.20 Tm ([-YRrdoKG1xs @ 00:07:47]. The math is explicit: at a $50 billable call with one in five taken, the publisher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 515.97 Tm (earns $10 per call and must generate calls for $6 to $8, while taking half unlocks the $15 to $20 calls) Tj ET
