BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 470.30 Tm (impersonating the Department of Insurance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.07 Tm (Lead and transfer quality fails in predictable ways. Willie Goldberg's two-week test of 49 transfers at $25) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.85 Tm (each produced 5 sales, roughly one in ten, putting cost per sale near $250 to $300, and the ACA pool was) Tj ET
