BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 409.40 Tm (sold leads and recycling them within 30, 60, or 90 days, which means lower persistency and more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.17 Tm (replacement, plus ads that mislead with free, Social Security, or VA claims, which Goldberg calls a very) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 378.95 Tm (shady practice [A4zDgHX2VWI @ 00:09:22]. Tyler Glennon hits the same mismatch from the agent chair:) Tj ET
