BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (and twenty seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (Ringba's negotiation session treats payout as permanently movable. Never make the first offer. Deflecting) Tj ET
