BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (braces caller on a 40-second call with about 35 seconds of talk time against a 1:30 conversion threshold,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and smaller buyers running 10 to 30 agents are likelier to pull it [JxU9bgFTUUs @ 00:14:42]. Detection is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (mechanical: filter non-converted calls, sort by duration highest to lowest under the threshold, group by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (buyer, ignore 5-to-8-second calls, then hand the network the recording and caller ID and demand a QA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (addendum carrying a 50% penalty per CPA [JxU9bgFTUUs @ 00:20:34]. The same speaker flags) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (automated IVR selection: around 40% is the benchmark, 50 to 60% is fine, and roughly 100% is fraud) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([JxU9bgFTUUs @ 00:40:16]. TrackDrive's warning list covers the traffic side: the same number calling 20) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (times a day, many calls ending at 58 or 59 seconds against a 60-second minimum, out-of-state or off-hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (calls, a sudden spike from one sub ID, and pre-recorded audio, with the rule that a pattern proves a problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (while a single sign does not [y8V08rKKNWY @ 00:01:21]. Read the pattern, then pull the recording.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Scaling breaks operators who skip infrastructure. John Ventura says most beginners find one affiliate and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (one buyer, track everything in a spreadsheet, and watch it fail within about three days, ending in the classic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (dispute where the buyer counts 40 qualified calls and the affiliate claims 60; even at scale, AdSync spent six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (figures a year just managing Ringba and Retreaver [KeC4mKXnzs4 @ 00:09:02]. The Ventura scaling gate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (is a billable rate of at least 50%, positive post-reconciliation margins, and clean QA, with an explicit warning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (against adding 10 affiliates at once [KeC4mKXnzs4 @ 00:11:09]. Andy on Beginner to 1K a Day Journey) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (blames dips on Google Ads updates and reports that legal tests on Facebook, Instagram, and Google spent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (more than they earned, while Market Call has no legal vertical at all [Cea6GBkjsgg @ 00:03:33]. Buyer) Tj ET
